flowchart TD
    A[Timer1 ISR] --> B[read sensors via AVR registers]
    B --> C{stepRun?}
    C -->|No| D[STEP LOW / return]
    C -->|Yes| E{Endschalter in Fahrtrichtung?}
    E -->|Yes| F[stop stepRun / update measurement]
    E -->|No| G[toggle STEP]
    G --> H{STEP falling edge?}
    H -->|No| I[return]
    H -->|Yes| J[position +/- 1]
    J --> K[reference edge detection]
    K --> I
